{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1220184-prime-1-attainment","id":1220184,"title":"Prime 1 Attainment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-18T22:27:11-07:00","id":1220184,"title":"Prime 1 Attainment","content":"Trickle Charge<br /> <br /> As Mana flow constantly through a mage's body, a basic exercise in the handling of it is to divert a small amount of that flow to the mage's personal stores, in a manner less crude and dangerous than Scouring. The mage gains a point of Mana every (8-Prime) days, to normal maximum.<br /> <br /> The intent of this Attainment is to serve as a &quot;back up&quot; source of Mana, allowing mages to replenish themselves without need of tass, Pattern Scouring, or a Hallow, while still keeping those things highly desirable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T03:30:54-07:00","id":1220219,"title":"","content":"Mana doesn\u2019t flow through a Mage\u2019s body if there isn\u2019t any mana in it, and simply having mana in your body can\u2019t create more of it. That would be like if you could eat a meal once and then your body just used that meal to keep you alive and energized the rest of your life.<br /> <br /> If you want mana without a Hallow or Scouring, try sacrifice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;bas